ustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project/september-reimbursements.csv\u001b\\september-reimbursements.csv\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;243m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\. This directory has an expense-report prototype from our earlier work. Inspect it and use or improve it so\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;243mI can reproduce the report next month, with totals by category and a grand total. Do not silently include questionable amounts. Save the\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;243musable report and a short handoff explaining how to run it and any data problems. Verify the actual output before you hand it over; work\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;243mdirectly for now.\"\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252minspecting \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project/report.py\u001b\\report.py\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\, tests, and CSV directly via bash\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mrunning the report and test suite to verify against the live CSV\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mwriting the handoff, then fixing the three fixture-dependent tests\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mcleaning the bytecode cache and doing a final check of the artifacts\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;238m$ read the diff\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;103m\u25aa done\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \u001b[38;5;235m\u2191\u001b[38;5;243m 18.1k\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;238m\u2193\u001b[38;5;252m 15.3k\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;243m\u2500 \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;116mdeepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;243m (together):auto \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;173m\u25c7 YOLO\u001b[38;5;243m \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 \u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;110m$0.04\u001b[38;5;243m \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;252m\u27f2 saved $0.0142 \u00b7 83% cached\u001b[38;5;243m   \u001b[38;5;252m18.1k/1M \u00b7 2%\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;146m\u280b\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;146mworking\u001b[38;5;243m \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;146m46s\u001b[38;5;243m \u2500\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;243m\u203a \u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\r\n \u001b[38;5;116mesc\u001b[38;5;243m interrupt\u001b[39m                                                              \u001b[38;5;243mproject: /tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project\u001b[39m"]
